#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:136
msgid ""
"Registers a callback for events from the BLE stack. The *handler* takes two "
"arguments, ``event`` (which will be one of the codes below) and ``data`` "
"(which is an event-specific tuple of values)."
msgstr ""
"Rekisteröi takaisinkutsun BLE-pinon tapahtumille. *handler* ottaa kaksi "
"argumenttia, ``event`` (joka on jokin alla olevista koodeista) ja ``data`` "
"(joka on tapahtumakohtainen arvojen monikko)."

